We can select this layer.

42
00:02:54,000 --> 00:02:57,500
The width of the side can be adjusted accordingly according to the effect.

43
00:02:57,500 --> 00:03:00,759
In this way, an area can be made on the edge of the board.

44
00:03:00,759 --> 00:03:02,360
There will be no hair inside.

45
00:03:02,360 --> 00:03:04,759
Then there will be a pressure mark effect.

46
00:03:04,759 --> 00:03:07,199
At the same time, we can put the place without the seal,

47
00:03:07,199 --> 00:03:08,560
which is our collar,

48
00:03:08,560 --> 00:03:10,759
can be wiped off the side of the side.

49
00:03:10,759 --> 00:03:13,759
Then, in the same way,

50
00:03:13,759 --> 00:03:16,159
a process is carried out in other parts.

51
00:03:16,159 --> 00:03:20,400
Then, after the process is done, a default picture is like this.

52
00:03:20,400 --> 00:03:25,640
Finally, let's come to this costume again.

53
00:03:25,640 --> 00:03:28,640
We choose the large fabric.

54
00:03:28,640 --> 00:03:31,640
Then open it in the default picture.

55
00:03:31,640 --> 00:03:35,060
Put the default picture we just made into the density column.

56
00:03:35,060 --> 00:03:38,060
The hair density of the black area will be zero,

57
00:03:38,060 --> 00:03:39,259
so there will be no hair.

58
00:03:39,259 --> 00:03:43,560
In the white area, the density of the hair will maintain the original density.

59
00:03:43,560 --> 00:03:46,259
In this way, the hair can be processed.

60
